T("On (default): the game never waits for a new shader to compile: what needs one still compiling is left out until it is ready, usually one frame (an effect pops in a frame late). Pictures the game draws only once (the save file's screenshot, the pause menu's background, terrain tiles) still wait for theirs. Off: every draw waits for its shader, a short stutter the first time an effect appears.", "開（預設）：遊戲從不等待新著色器編譯完成：需要仍在編譯中的著色器的內容會被略過，直到它準備好，通常只有一格畫面（效果晚一格出現）。遊戲只繪製一次的圖像（存檔的截圖、暫停選單的背景、地形圖塊）仍會等待各自的著色器。關：每次繪製都等待其著色器，效果首次出現時會短暫卡頓。")
