T("On suits G-SYNC and FreeSync. Fast: no tearing and no waiting.", "G-SYNC和FreeSync請選「開」。快速：無撕裂也無等待。")
T("On: no tearing; the game waits for the display. With G-SYNC or FreeSync the display waits for the game instead: each frame shows as soon as it's ready, and the frame rate stays a little under the display's refresh rate. Fast: no tearing and no waiting: each refresh shows the newest frame. Adaptive: as On, but a frame that comes late shows at once and may tear. Off: each frame shows at once: the least delay, but it tears.", "開：無畫面撕裂；遊戲等待顯示器。使用G-SYNC或FreeSync時則由顯示器等待遊戲：每幀一準備好就顯示，幀率保持在顯示器更新率稍下。快速：無撕裂也無等待：每次刷新顯示最新的一幀。自適應：同「開」，但遲到的幀會立即顯示，可能撕裂。關：每幀立即顯示：延遲最低，但畫面會撕裂。")
T("With On and Adaptive, the frame rate on this display goes up to about %d FPS.", "使用「開」和「自適應」時，此顯示器上的幀率最高約為%d FPS。")
T("How many pictures a second the game draws. The game itself runs at the same speed at every rate (the console runs it at 30). Higher rates need a faster computer. Menus, cutscenes and conversations use it too, and videos play at their own speed. Off: as many as the computer can draw.", "遊戲每秒繪製的畫面數。遊戲本身在任何影格速率下速度都相同（主機上為30）。更高的影格速率需要更快的電腦。選單、過場動畫和對話也使用此影格速率，影片則以自身速度播放。關：電腦能畫多少就畫多少。")
T("Your display refreshes %d times a second: a rate above that shows no more pictures, and one that divides it evenly is the smoothest.", "你的螢幕每秒更新%d次：高於此值的影格速率不會顯示更多畫面，能整除它的影格速率最流暢。")
