T("Sharper sun shadows. Extreme can cut the frame rate to a third in forests, even on a fast GPU.", "太陽的陰影更清晰。極致在森林中可能讓幀率降到三分之一，即使是高速GPU。")
T("The size of the maps the sun's shadows are drawn from. Console: the game's own, 896 x 896. High (2048), Ultra (4096) and Extreme (8192) give sharper shadow edges (Link, trees, buildings) for more GPU time and video memory (Ultra: about 100 MB, Extreme: about 400 MB). Extreme is very heavy where there is a lot of foliage: in a forest it can cut the frame rate to a third, even on a fast GPU. Ultra or lower suits most GPUs.", "繪製太陽陰影所用貼圖的大小。主機：遊戲原本的896 x 896。高（2048）、超高（4096）和極致（8192）讓陰影邊緣（林克、樹木、建築）更清晰，但會占用更多GPU時間和顯示記憶體（超高：約100 MB，極致：約400 MB）。在枝葉繁多的地方,極致非常吃效能：在森林中即使是高速GPU，幀率也可能降到三分之一。大多數GPU適合超高或更低。")
