T("Twice the frames on screen. Adds a little delay.", "畫面上的影格數加倍。會增加些許延遲。")
T("AMD FSR 3 makes a frame between each two the game draws: about twice the frames on screen. The frame rate above counts them all, so the game itself draws half of it (60 with 120) and the controls answer as at that rate, a little later. In play only: the menus and the map show the game's own frames. Fast moves can leave faint smears around Link and what moves on its own.", "AMD FSR 3在遊戲繪製的每兩個影格之間產生一個影格：畫面上的影格數約為兩倍。上方的影格率計入所有影格，所以遊戲本身只繪製一半（選120時為60），操作的反應和該影格率相同，略有延遲。僅在遊玩時：選單和地圖顯示遊戲本身的影格。快速移動時，林克和自行移動的物體周圍可能留下淡淡的殘影。")
