T("Clicking both sticks together turns the free camera on and off. Home on the keyboard always does.", "同時按下兩個搖桿可開啟或關閉自由視角。鍵盤上的 Home 鍵始終可用。")

T("Sharper text", "更清晰的文字")
T("Upscales the game's letters for 1440p and 4K, after a restart. Not the original art.", "為 1440p 和 4K 放大遊戲的文字，重新啟動後生效。不是原版美術。")
T("Makes the game's letters sharper on 1440p and 4K screens. It takes effect the next time you start the game. This is an upscale made on your computer from the game's own letters, not Nintendo's original art: the shapes are kept, but they aren't exactly as drawn. 4x takes a moment longer to start and uses more video memory.", "讓遊戲的文字在 1440p 和 4K 螢幕上更清晰。下次啟動遊戲時生效。這是在你的電腦上根據遊戲本身的文字放大的，不是任天堂的原版美術：形狀保留，但與原畫並不完全相同。4x 啟動稍慢，並佔用更多顯示記憶體。")
T("Game's FXAA", "遊戲內建 FXAA")
T("The game's own edge smoothing. Off: sharper, more jagged edges.", "遊戲內建的邊緣平滑。關閉：更銳利，但邊緣鋸齒更多。")
T("The game's own FXAA, which smooths edges as the 3D image is drawn into the final picture, as on the console. Off: a sharper image with more jagged edges; use it to replace FXAA with SMAA or TAA above, or to keep the image crisp at a high resolution.", "遊戲內建的 FXAA，在把 3D 畫面繪製到最終畫面時平滑邊緣，與主機上相同。關閉：畫面更銳利，但邊緣鋸齒更多；可用於以上方的 SMAA 或 TAA 取代 FXAA，或在高解析度下保持畫面清晰。")
